  "prefLabel": "Ed 1304.01 Advisory Committees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1304.01 Advisory Committees. Regions and regional career and technical education centers shall establish and maintain the regional advisory committees and program advisory committees, respectively, per RSA 188-E:4-a.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1300) #12573, eff 7-14-18",
